\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargeStationaryReflection}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}large\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargeStationaryReflection}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\omega&lt;\\alpha\\land\n\\operatorname{Stationary}(S\\cap\\alpha,\\alpha)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}large\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargeStationaryReflection}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\omega&lt;\\alpha\\land\n\\operatorname{Stationary}(S\\cap\\alpha,\\alpha)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream stationarity predicate already supplies regular-cardinal and subset guards for both <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> and the reflection point <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>; no unsourced cofinality abbreviation is needed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationar